      <h2 class="h2" id="process-title" data-scramble>Three steps, and the last one doesn't end</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="track" id="track">
      <svg class="circuit" id="circuit" aria-hidden="true"><path class="c-base" id="c-path"/><path class="c-loop" id="c-loop"/></svg>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step hud" data-reveal="up">
          <span class="step__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__h"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="step-1" data-cursor="Open"><i>01</i>Audit</button></h3>
          <p class="step__p">We go through your network and see what's on it, how it's set up and who can get to what.</p>
          <div class="step__more" id="step-1"><div><ul class="term"><li>&gt; inventory devices</li><li>&gt; check accounts and access</li><li>&gt; review backups</li></ul></div></div>
        </li>
        <li class="step hud" data-reveal="up">
          <span class="step__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__h"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="step-2" data-cursor="Open"><i>02</i>Analyze</button></h3>
          <p class="step__p">We sort the risks and threats by how much they could hurt your business, and explain them in plain English.</p>
          <div class="step__more" id="step-2"><div><ul class="term"><li>&gt; rank what we found</li><li>&gt; explain it without jargon</li><li>&gt; agree what to fix first</li></ul></div></div>
        </li>
        <li class="step step--loop hud" data-reveal="up">
          <span class="step__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__h"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="step-3" data-cursor="Open"><i>03</i>Monitor &amp; maintain<svg class="ekg" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M0 12h12l3-7 5 14 4-10 3 3h21"/></svg></button></h3>
          <p class="step__p">Once things are in order, we keep watching the network and keep it maintained.</p>
          <div class="step__more" id="step-3"><div><ul class="term"><li>&gt; watch the network</li><li>&gt; apply updates</li><li>&gt; fix what turns up</li><li>&gt; repeat</li></ul></div></div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

