        <h3 class="sr-only" id="diag-h">What it might mean</h3>
        <p class="diag__empty" id="diag-empty">Nothing picked yet. Choose a symptom and we'll explain what it might mean and what we'd check.</p>
        <ol class="diag__list" id="diag-list" aria-live="polite"></ol>
